      "registry_source": "dyntaxa",
      "registry_namespace": "dyntaxa_taxon_id",
      "description": "Dyntaxa publishes its DwC:taxonID values verbatim as LSIDs. Accepted rows carry a taxon-concept LSID 'urn:lsid:dyntaxa.se:Taxon:<n>'; synonym rows carry a name LSID 'urn:lsid:dyntaxa.se:TaxonName:<n>' and point at the accepted concept through acceptedNameUsageID. The value is stored as the full LSID text, never stripped to an integer. The relationship of <n> to Artportalen taxon ids is recorded, not assumed, in database/taxonomy/evidence/taxonomy-v3/stage4p/."
    }
